WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
narrator: Start the three-peer fixture.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
narrator: Native DERP shares the mesh control listener.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
narrator: Inspect peer one's view of the roster.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
narrator: Query machine status through the mounted admin API.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
narrator: Mesh membership is separate from paid traffic admission.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
narrator: Teardown ends this local interoperability fixture.
